  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given, $E_{n}=13.6 \\mathrm{eV}$<br />Energy of an electron in $n^{\\text {th }}$ state<br />$E_{n}=\\frac{-13.6 z^{2} \\mathrm{eV}}{n^{2}}$<br />$\\therefore$ Energy of an electron in $n=2$ state<br />$E_{2}=\\frac{18-6 z^{2}}{(2)^{2}}=-34 e V$<br />So.<br />$\\begin{aligned}<br />P E &=2 E_{n=2} \\\\<br />&=2 \\times(-3.4) \\\\<br />&=-6.8 \\mathrm{eV}<br />\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
